{"id":"en_the-millionaire-wife-strikes-back","title":"The Millionaire Wife Strikes Back","titleEn":"The Millionaire Wife Strikes Back","description":"For a decade, Anuradha devoted herself to looking after a mother-in-law she believed was paralyzed. The truth turns out to be far crueler: the woman is not Rajiv's mother at all, but the mother of his mistress, who has been passing herself off as his sister. Rather than break down, Anuradha quietly assembles proof of the deception. She liquidates the villa that came to her as dowry, brings the fraudulent scheme to light, ends her marriage to Rajiv, and starts over, building both a new career and a new life.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-millionaire-wife-strikes-back/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-millionaire-wife-strikes-back/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Drama","Karma Payback","Underdog Rise"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dayje/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-millionaire-wife-strikes-back_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dayje/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-millionaire-wife-strikes-back_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dayje/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-millionaire-wife-strikes-back_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dayje/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-millionaire-wife-strikes-back_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (